This license covers every file under vps-setup/ in this repository:
vps-setup.sh, apply.sh, packages.list, offline-debs.txt, Android.mk, and
everything under vps-setup/rootdir/.

The source is published so that users can read it, audit it, and build it for
their own device. It is not published for redistribution.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
WHY THIS STRICT LICENSE EXISTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

A headless server image is a target. It runs 24/7, it holds SSH keys, it sits on
someone's home network, and it has no screen — so nobody notices when it starts
doing something it was not asked to do.

The pattern is well documented. Someone forks a project like this one, strips
the author's name out, renames it, and publishes a "faster" or "optimised"
build. The build boots, the SSH login works, the README looks right. What the
user does not see is the extra payload: a crypto miner that keeps the CPU at
full tilt, a reverse shell that dials out on boot, or a tracker that reports the
device's address and credentials to a third party.

The user's experience is a phone that runs hot, drains battery, and feels slow.
They blame the ROM, or the hardware, or the kernel. They do not suspect that
the image they flashed is mining for someone else.

That is the failure mode this license exists to prevent. Repacking is not
forbidden here because of vanity. It is forbidden because a repacked build of
this project is indistinguishable from a compromised one, and the people who
suffer from that are the users, not the author.

If you want to build on this work, the terms below tell you how. If you want to
ship a modified build to other people, ask first.

